function exerciseGraphic(name){const a=liftArt[name];const figure=(p,x)=>{const line=(ids,color,width)=>`<polyline points="${ids.map(i=>p[i].join(',')).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="${color}" stroke-width="${width}" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>`;let prop='';if(a.prop==='chair')prop='<path d="M24 86 H49 M25 86 V128 M48 86 V128 M24 86 V65" stroke="#d2baff" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/>';if(a.prop==='support')prop='<path d="M12 58 H28 M18 58 V130" stroke="#d2baff" stroke-width="4"/>';if(a.prop==='bench'||a.prop==='row')prop='<path d="M10 101 H40 M15 101 V130 M35 101 V130" stroke="#d2baff" stroke-width="4"/>';const dumb=(pos)=>`<path d="M${pos[0]-9} ${pos[1]} h18" stroke="#ffd576" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M${pos[0]-9} ${pos[1]-5} v10 M${pos[0]+9} ${pos[1]-5} v10" stroke="#ffd576" stroke-width="5"/>`;return `<g transform="translate(${x},20)">${prop}<path d="M7 132 H132" stroke="#ffffff30"/><circle cx="${p[0][0]}" cy="${p[0][1]}" r="10" fill="#f3d2ae"/>${line([1,2],'#bc91ff',15)}${line([2,3,4],'#e6dcf7',8)}${line([2,5,6],'#e6dcf7',8)}${line([1,7,8],'#f3d2ae',6)}${line([1,9,10],'#f3d2ae',6)}${a.prop==='weights'?dumb(p[8])+dumb(p[10]):a.prop==='row'?dumb(p[10]):a.prop==='carry'?dumb(p[x>100?10:8]):''}</g>`};return `<svg viewBox="0 0 340 185" role="img" aria-label="${escapeHTML(name+': '+a.cue)}">${figure(a.poses[0],9)}${figure(a.poses[1],191)}<path d="M158 86 h22 m-6 -6 6 6 -6 6" stroke="#ffd576" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="80" y="179" text-anchor="middle">${a.prop==='carry'?'LEFT SIDE':'START'}</text><text x="265" y="179" text-anchor="middle">${a.prop==='carry'?'SWITCH HANDS':'MOVE'}</text></svg>`}
function cardRecord(){const r=data.trainingSessions[sessionKey]||(data.trainingSessions[sessionKey]={completed:[]});if(!r.setChecks)r.setChecks={};if(!r.goalSets)r.goalSets=data.sets[player]===2?2:1;return r}
function cardSlots(i){const r=cardRecord(),e=workouts[day][i];return Array.from({length:r.goalSets},(_,s)=>(e[2]?['Left','Right']:['']).map(side=>({key:i+'-'+s+'-'+side,round:s+1,side}))).flat()}
function moveCard(delta){exerciseIndex=Math.max(0,Math.min(workouts[day].length-1,exerciseIndex+delta));liftSession()}
function cardComplete(){clearSessionClock();hub.innerHTML=`<div class="deck-finish"><span class="deck-star">✦</span><p class="quiet-label">STRENGTH ${day} · COMPLETE</p><h1>Deck complete.</h1><p>Five movements. Good work showing up.</p><p>Finish with easy walking. What felt more controlled today?</p><button class="primary" data-log="Home session">Save reflection</button><button data-hub="Today">Back to sessions</button></div>`}
function liftSession(){clearSessionClock();clockRemaining=60;clockKind='rest';document.body.classList.add('lesson-mode');const e=workouts[day][exerciseIndex],r=cardRecord(),a=liftArt[e[0]],slots=cardSlots(exerciseIndex),finished=r.completed.includes(exerciseIndex),next=slots.find(s=>!r.setChecks[s.key]),count=finished?slots.length:slots.filter(s=>r.setChecks[s.key]).length;hub.innerHTML=`<div class="deck-top"><button data-hub="Today">← Exit</button><span>STRENGTH ${day} <b>${r.completed.length}/5 complete</b></span></div><div class="deck-dots" aria-label="Exercise navigation">${workouts[day].map((w,i)=>`<button data-card-index="${i}" aria-label="Exercise ${i+1}: ${escapeHTML(w[0])}${r.completed.includes(i)?', complete':''}" ${i===exerciseIndex?'aria-current="step"':''} class="${r.completed.includes(i)?'checked':''}">${r.completed.includes(i)?'✓':i+1}</button>`).join('')}</div><article class="athlete-card" tabindex="0" aria-label="${escapeHTML(e[0])} exercise card"><div class="card-ribbon"><span>GALAXY / STRENGTH CLUB</span><b>0${exerciseIndex+1}</b></div><div class="card-art"><span class="card-type">${a.tag}</span>${exerciseGraphic(e[0])}<p>${a.skill}</p></div><div class="card-body"><h1>${e[0]}</h1><div class="card-stats"><div><strong>${r.goalSets}</strong><span>${r.goalSets===1?'SET':'SETS'}</span></div><div><strong>${e[1]}</strong><span>${e[4]==='hold'?'SECONDS':'REPS'}${e[2]?' / SIDE':''}</span></div><div><strong>60<span>s</span></strong><span>REST</span></div></div><p class="card-cue">${a.cue}</p><div class="card-video">${demoLink(strengthDemos[day][exerciseIndex+1][0])}</div><details class="card-details"><summary>Technique & why it matters</summary><p>${e[4]==='hold'?'Hold one light dumbbell. Stay upright; switch hands for the other side.':e[3]}</p><p>${whyExercise[e[0]][0]}</p><p>Use a comfortable load. Stop for pain. Ask an adult to check your form.</p></details><div class="card-set-status" role="status">${finished?'✓ All sets complete':`Set ${next.round} of ${r.goalSets}${next.side?' · '+next.side+' side':''}`}<span>${count}/${slots.length} checked</span></div><button class="card-done" data-card-done ${finished?'disabled':''}>${finished?'Exercise complete ✓':next.side?next.side+' side done ✓':'Set done ✓'}</button>${count>0?'<button class="card-undo" data-card-undo>Undo last check</button>':''}</div></article><div class="deck-controls"><button data-card-step="-1" ${exerciseIndex===0?'disabled':''}>← Previous</button><span>Swipe to browse</span><button data-card-step="1" ${exerciseIndex===4?'disabled':''}>Next →</button></div><details class="card-rest"><summary>Rest / hold timer</summary><div class="session-timer"><strong id="sessionSeconds">60</strong><span id="sessionTimerLabel"> seconds · rest</span><div class="row"><button data-run-clock="60">Start rest</button>${e[4]==='hold'?'<button data-run-clock="15">Start hold</button>':''}<button data-pause-clock>Pause</button><button data-resume-clock>Resume</button></div></div></details>`;persist();window.scrollTo(0,0)}
function ballSession(){document.body.classList.add('lesson-mode');hub.innerHTML=`<button data-hub="Today">← Sessions</button><h1>Control, see, connect.</h1><p>Use this instead of extra conditioning. On practice or game days, choose just one short drill if fresh.</p>${['touch','scan','pass'].map((id,i)=>{const l=lessonById[id];return `<details class="quiet-collection" ${i===0?'open':''}><summary>${i+1}. ${l.title}</summary><p><strong>Why:</strong> ${l.why}</p><p><strong>Solo:</strong> ${l.solo}</p><p><strong>Brother:</strong> ${l.duo}</p><p>Try five controlled attempts each, pause to discuss, then repeat once if fresh. Quality before speed.</p>${demoLink(l.video[0])}<details><summary>Add a decision</summary><p>${l.pressure}</p></details></details>`}).join('')}<button data-log="Home session" class="primary">Finish & reflect</button>`}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(!b)return;const d=b.dataset;if(d.liftSession){day=d.liftSession;sessionKey=player+'|'+localDate()+'|'+day;const prior=data.trainingSessions[sessionKey];exerciseIndex=prior?workouts[day].findIndex((_,i)=>!prior.completed.includes(i)):0;if(exerciseIndex<0){showHub('Progress');return}hub.innerHTML=`<button data-hub="Today">← Sessions</button><h1>Get ready.</h1><p>Warm up with easy movement, then rehearse each exercise without weight. Use a stable surface and clear space.</p><p>New to lifting? Have a qualified adult teach and check your form. Soccer experience does not replace lifting instruction.</p><p>Skip this session if sore, unwell or a match is close. Stop for pain.</p><button class="primary" data-lift-ready>Ready · begin</button>`;document.body.classList.add('lesson-mode')}
 if(d.liftReady!==undefined)liftSession();if(d.liftBack!==undefined&&exerciseIndex>0){exerciseIndex--;liftSession()}if(d.cardIndex!==undefined){exerciseIndex=Number(d.cardIndex);liftSession()}if(d.cardStep)moveCard(Number(d.cardStep));if(d.cardDone!==undefined){const r=cardRecord(),slots=cardSlots(exerciseIndex),next=slots.find(s=>!r.setChecks[s.key]);if(!r.completed.includes(exerciseIndex)&&next){r.setChecks[next.key]=true;if(slots.every(s=>r.setChecks[s.key]))r.completed.push(exerciseIndex);persist();if(r.completed.length===5){r.completedAt=new Date().toISOString();persist();cardComplete()}else liftSession()}}if(d.cardUndo!==undefined){const r=cardRecord(),slots=cardSlots(exerciseIndex);if(r.completed.includes(exerciseIndex)&&!slots.some(s=>r.setChecks[s.key]))slots.forEach(s=>r.setChecks[s.key]=true);const last=slots.filter(s=>r.setChecks[s.key]).pop();if(last){delete r.setChecks[last.key];r.completed=r.completed.filter(i=>i!==exerciseIndex);delete r.completedAt;persist();liftSession()}}
 if(d.runClock||d.resumeClock!==undefined){clearSessionClock();if(d.runClock){clockRemaining=Number(d.runClock);clockKind=clockRemaining===15?'hold':'rest'}clockDeadline=Date.now()+clockRemaining*1000;const update=()=>{clockRemaining=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((clockDeadline-Date.now())/1000));$('sessionSeconds').textContent=clockRemaining;$('sessionTimerLabel').textContent=clockRemaining?' seconds · '+clockKind:' · complete';if(!clockRemaining)clearSessionClock()};update();if(clockRemaining)sessionClock=setInterval(update,250)}if(d.pauseClock!==undefined){if(sessionClock)clockRemaining=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((clockDeadline-Date.now())/1000));clearSessionClock()}if(d.ballSession!==undefined)ballSession();if(d.log)clearSessionClock();});
showHub('Today');

let cardTouch=null;document.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.athlete-card')&&!e.target.closest('button,a,summary'))cardTouch={x:e.touches[0].clientX,y:e.touches[0].clientY};else cardTouch=null},{passive:true});document.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{if(!cardTouch)return;const dx=e.changedTouches[0].clientX-cardTouch.x,dy=e.changedTouches[0].clientY-cardTouch.y;cardTouch=null;if(Math.abs(dx)>55&&Math.abs(dx)>Math.abs(dy)*1.5)moveCard(dx<0?1:-1)},{passive:true});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.athlete-card')&&!e.target.closest('button,a,summary')){if(e.key==='ArrowRight')moveCard(1);if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')moveCard(-1)}});
